      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow4:136",
        "answer": "Missing queue returns; empty queue sets pumping=false. Nonempty queue scans priorities below the initial 10, errors if none is valid, sets pumping=true, removes the selected item and invokes its callback immediately with element/index/paramData. clipBased branch is empty; pumpTime branch creates a recursive pump timer. The recovered Invalid Timing Type error follows that conditional unconditionally on the nonempty path. Do not repair it into an else or omit it after scheduling. Initializes absent queue to {}, absent next index to 1, and a falsy pumping flag to false. Existing truthy values are retained; it neither enqueues nor pumps.",
